{
  "situation": "We know from NOC and DPA that OpCo's support chatbot exposed other subscribers' billing addresses and call records in about 1,200 sessions over three days due to a vendor update, and that the vendor hosts model and chat logs outside the UAE. We do not yet have OpCo's formal report on root cause, containment, affected subscribers, notifications, or whether a pre-deployment impact assessment was performed.",
  "claims": [
    {
